<h1 data-copy-en="Bellavia" data-copy-zh="Bellavia">Bellavia</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Find Bellavia’s cellar interactions, crafted-gift upgrades and resort activities without route revelations." data-copy-zh="查找Bellavia的地窖互动、手工礼物升级及度假活动，避开剧情揭示。">Find Bellavia’s cellar interactions, crafted-gift upgrades and resort activities without route revelations.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Clothing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="One-Time_Resort_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk_with_Bellavia"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Resort_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Personal_Relationship_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Meeting_Bellavia_and_Opening_the_Cellar"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Bellavia — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/bellavia.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Bellavia — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/bellavia.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Bellavia — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Bellavia’s current content includes cellar conversation, a repeatable private activity, two crafted-gift upgrades and resort visits. The circumstances of her introduction are left to the story.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Her cellar access becomes available after Story 59. Once she is available and home, her portrait is at Cellar all day; an arranged resort vacation replaces that home schedule.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Later_Main-Story_Requirements"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Build affection with Talk. Cellar Feeding unlocks at Crush 400,60 min/80 Energy, once/day, subject to its content lock. There is no separate home-date chain to complete first.</p><p>At In Love 3000 and home, either crafted gift below can be handed over once for its permanent training upgrade. Each costs one exact gift and 0 min; both require Story 59 completed. Each finished upgrade adds 50% to her income multiplier and doubles that training’s experience.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Crafted-Gift_Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worker_Visits_and_Eight_Training_Levels"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Bellavia</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Cellar; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 3/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cellar Feeding</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Cellar; Crush (400); content access indicated by the lock</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; 80 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+30 base affection; 1/day</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Crafted-gift scene</th><th scope="col">Where / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Cost</th><th scope="col">Training upgraded</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">After the Hunger</th><td data-label="Where / start window">Cellar</td><td data-label="Requirements">In Love (3000); home from vacation; Story 59</td><td data-label="Cost">0 min; hand in 1 Hexbound Rose Sachet</td><td data-label="Training upgraded">Cowgirl</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Every Era After</th><td data-label="Where / start window">Cellar</td><td data-label="Requirements">In Love (3000); home from vacation; Story 59</td><td data-label="Cost">0 min; hand in 1 Prismatic Spell Brooch</td><td data-label="Training upgraded">Missionary</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Talk gives 1 base affection in 20 min, three/day. Cellar Feeding gives 30 base affection and 70 player Erotic Experience; that global counter is separate from NPC intimacy experience.</p><p>Her resort content includes conversation, buffet, beach relaxation, private beach time, spa and the sunset-walk heart-to-heart. The walk starts 17:00–20:00 at the beach,60 min, once/day. Use the resort guide for the actual vacation rotation.</p><p>Favorite stats are Beast, Vampire, Intelligence. Learning Seduction improves the relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>Before the cellar becomes available, follow the current main-story objective rather than searching other bedrooms for her.</li><li>A gift upgrade needs the exact consumable and Bellavia home from vacation.</li><li>If the cellar portrait is absent, check her current availability and vacation status; raising affection does not create access early.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Staff and training</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-blacksmith-and-forge.html">Crafted gifts</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">Resort activities</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Intimacy counters</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Clothing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-One-Time_Resort_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk_with_Bellavia"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Resort_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Personal_Relationship_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Meeting_Bellavia_and_Opening_the_Cellar"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Bellavia 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/bellavia.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Bellavia 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/bellavia.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Bellavia 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Bellavia目前有地窖交谈、可重复私密活动、两项手工礼物升级及度假内容。初次见面的具体情节留给主线。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>完成主线59后可进入相关地窖内容。她当前可用且留在青楼时，全天位于地窖；安排度假后会改用度假行程。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Later_Main-Story_Requirements"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>可通过交谈提高好感。地窖喂食要求迷恋400，60分钟、80精力，每天一次，另须满足内容权限；不额外要求先完成一条青楼内约会链。</p><p>恋爱中3000且留在青楼时，可交付下表两件手工礼物，各完成一次永久训练升级。每项消耗指定礼物一件、0分钟，均要求主线59完成；收入倍率每项增加50%，对应训练获得双倍经验。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Crafted-Gift_Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_Visits_and_Eight_Training_Levels"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Bellavia 交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">地窖；陌生人（0好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天3次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">地窖喂食</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">地窖；迷恋（400好感）；满足锁形提示所示的内容权限</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；80精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+30；每天1次</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">手工礼物事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">消耗</th><th scope="col">升级训练</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">饥饿之后</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">地窖</td><td data-label="条件">恋爱中（3000好感）；已结束度假；主线59</td><td data-label="消耗">0分钟；交付咒缚玫瑰香囊×1</td><td data-label="升级训练">女上位</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">往后的每个时代</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">地窖</td><td data-label="条件">恋爱中（3000好感）；已结束度假；主线59</td><td data-label="消耗">0分钟；交付棱彩法术胸针×1</td><td data-label="升级训练">传教士位</td></tr></tbody></table><p>交谈20分钟、1基础好感，每天三次。地窖喂食增加30基础好感和70玩家情趣经验；全局情趣经验与NPC亲密经验分开计算。</p><p>度假时可交谈、用餐、海滩休息、享受私密时光、水疗及进行日落散步交心。散步在海滩17:00–20:00开始，60分钟，每天一次；实际度假轮换见度假指南。</p><p>偏好的属性为兽性、吸血鬼、智力。学会诱惑可提高关系加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>地窖尚未开放时，先推进当前主线目标，不必去其他卧室寻找她。</li><li>礼物升级需要指定消耗品，且Bellavia已结束度假。</li><li>没有头像时，检查当前可用状态与度假状态；提高好感不能提前开放入口。</li></ul></section>
